(Biesse Skill 1224 - X/Y/Z warm-up)
(Machine coordinates via G53, 100 mm inside the soft limits:)
(  X -3259.6 .. -98    soft limits X -3359.6 .. 2)
(  Y -1628 .. -98      soft limits Y -1728 .. 2)
(Z first rises to the top, machine Z0. At the start of every lap, with X/Y stopped at the)
(X min / Y min corner, Z strokes down 4 in [101.6 mm, to machine Z -101.6] and back twice.)
(X/Y only ever move with Z at the top. Keep 4 in clear below the spindle at that corner.)
(Each pass: Z strokes, then rectangle + both diagonals.)
(Lead-in lap at 12 m/min [Z 1.5 m/min], then 2 cycles ramping to the X/Y maximum:)
(  cycle 1 = 30 m/min, cycle 2 = 60 m/min [Z 3 m/min, its maximum], then parks. About 5 minutes.)

G21 G90 G17 G94 G40 G64 P0.1
M5 M9

(bounds, cycles and top speed)
#<_xmin> = -3259.6
#<_xmax> = -98
#<_ymin> = -1628
#<_ymax> = -98
#<_cycles> = 2
#<_fmax> = 60000
#<_zdown> = -101.6
#<_zfeed> = 3000

o300 sub
  (Z strokes at the current X/Y; #1 = Z feed mm/min)
  o310 repeat [2]
    G53 G1 Z#<_zdown> F#1
    G53 G1 Z0
  o310 endrepeat
o300 endsub

o100 sub
  (#1 = X/Y feed mm/min, #2 = Z feed mm/min)
  o300 call [#2]
  G53 G1 X#<_xmin> Y#<_ymin> F#1
  G53 G1 X#<_xmax> Y#<_ymin>
  G53 G1 X#<_xmax> Y#<_ymax>
  G53 G1 X#<_xmin> Y#<_ymax>
  G53 G1 X#<_xmin> Y#<_ymin>
  G53 G1 X#<_xmax> Y#<_ymax>
  G53 G1 X#<_xmin> Y#<_ymax>
  G53 G1 X#<_xmax> Y#<_ymin>
  G53 G1 X#<_xmin> Y#<_ymin>
o100 endsub

(Z to the top first, then move to the start corner at a gentle feed)
G53 G1 Z0 F1500
G53 G1 X#<_xmin> Y#<_ymin> F5000

(lead-in lap)
o100 call [12000] [1500]

#<cycle> = 1
o200 repeat [#<_cycles>]
  (feed rises evenly and reaches _fmax on the last cycle)
  o100 call [#<_fmax> * #<cycle> / #<_cycles>] [#<_zfeed>]
  #<cycle> = [#<cycle> + 1]
o200 endrepeat

(park in the middle of the table)
G53 G1 X-1678.8 Y-863 F6000

M2
